{
  "name": "Boss CE-2 Chorus",
  "category": "Modulation",
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "version": 3,
  "description": "ET-50B CE-2 engaged circuit from the Boss service notes. Includes the original pre/de-emphasis and anti-alias/reconstruction filters, TL022 rate/depth oscillator, dry/wet summing and a clocked 1024-stage MN3007 model. The MN3101 is a calibrated clock-period approximation from Q4's divided control voltage; clock feedthrough, electronic bypass and power conditioning are omitted. The comparator has simulation compensation and the integrator is seeded at startup.",
